# Purpose/owner: select the entire native recovery OperatorRequest, never individual secrets.
# Type/units: one canonical absolute path string; no units.
# Required/default: optional explicit --env-file; if supplied this key is required, no default.
# Permitted values: existing protected regular single-link JSON with all15 fields and format_version=1.
# Secret handling: path reference only; credentials/keyring bytes must never be literal env values.
# Precedence/mapping: validates the base --request first, then replaces it through LoadOperatorRequest.
# Restart/reload: read once per operator invocation; next invocation uses changed validated inputs.
# Duplicate/unknown/empty/relative assignments and ambient process values are refused or ignored.
PROJECT_ONE_DAMENG_RECOVERY_REQUEST_FILE=/run/projectone/recovery/operator-request.json
